# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Virtual environments
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python caches / build artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PDFs: ignore by default, but DO track our own compiled correspondence.
#   * Joint_Resource_Allocation_..._June2024.pdf and d3qn.pdf are third-party
#     published papers (redistribution is not ours to grant) -- they are cited
#     in the README instead.
#   * paper_taes/thz_ml_spectrum_allocation.pdf is OUR paper (TAES Correspondence)
#     and is tracked, together with the vector figures it includes (negated below).
#     (The superseded IEEEtran version in paper/ was removed in Oct 2026.)
#   * paper_ojvt/ojvt.pdf is the CURRENT paper (IEEE OJVT, Nov 2026), tracked
#     with its figure PDFs for the same reason.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pdf
!paper_taes/thz_ml_spectrum_allocation.pdf
!paper_taes/figures/*.pdf
!paper_ojvt/ojvt.pdf
!paper_ojvt/figures/*.pdf

