z.txt

# Internal engineering/design log -- not part of the public deliverable
CLAUDE.md
claude.md
.claude/

# Supervisor-meeting revision instructions (private) and the third-party IEEE
# template archive (its class/bst files are already copied into paper_taes/)
CLAUDE_updated.md
TAES+Template.zip
*.zip

